</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">“<em>I'm incredibly excited about the Sertifi acquisition because it accelerates our travel business, expanding our offering to support over 20,000 hotel locations globally. The combination of Flywire's payment solutions and Sertifi's vertical software and payments platform creates a powerful synergy, digitizing hospitality-specific workflows and associated payments. This acquisition aligns perfectly with our customer-centric approach and strengthens our commitment to delivering seamless experiences for travelers worldwide.</em>”</span></p> </td> 
