<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 27px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 29px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 27px; line-height: 29px;">Payer’s Payment Experience:</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">We've expanded our tokenization service to support pre-authorization workflows, helping to streamline repeat transactions. You can now request tokenization during pre-authorization and utilize these tokens for future charges. You can also pre-authorize a charge against a token.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
