<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 27px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 29px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 27px; line-height: 29px;">Flywire Dashboard:</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Additional information for payment details is now available including bank transfer instructions and credit card insights* (*please reach out to your RM for more details).</li> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">New filtering capabilities have been released including the ability to filter by MOTO transactions within incoming payments and payment requests.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
